{"id": "access-03", "channel": "email", "campaign": "diwali", "intent": {"goal": "SIP starts", "audience": "first-time investors", "cta": "Start a SIP", "channel": "email"}, "text": "Systematic investment plans facilitate disciplined, incremental capital accumulation by automating periodic contributions into diversified mutual fund portfolios, thereby mitigating the behavioural tendency to time market fluctuations. Consequently, investors benefit from rupee-cost averaging, whereby proportionally more units are acquired during corrections and fewer during appreciations, optimising the average acquisition cost over extended horizons. PayWise enables investors to configure contribution frequency, amount and duration independently, accommodating heterogeneous liquidity requirements.", "labels": [{"dimension": "access", "code": "A-01", "quote": "Systematic investment plans facilitate disciplined, incremental capital accumulation by automating periodic contributions into diversified mutual fund portfolios, thereby mitigating the behavioural tendency to time market fluctuations", "severity": "suggestion"}, {"dimension": "tone", "code": "TV-02", "quote": "Systematic investment plans facilitate disciplined, incremental capital accumulation by automating periodic contributions into diversified mutual fund portfolios, thereby mitigating the behavioural tendency to time market fluctuations", "severity": "warning"}], "clean": false}
