{"id": "access-05-ok", "channel": "email", "campaign": "diwali", "intent": {"goal": "SIP starts", "audience": "first-time investors", "cta": "Start a SIP", "channel": "email"}, "text": "Hi Arjun,\n\nA SIP is a simple way to invest a little every month. You pick the amount. You pick the date. PayWise takes it from your bank on that day and buys units of the fund you chose.\n\nYou can start with Rs 500. You can pause or stop at any time from the app. There are no hidden charges, and you see exactly what you pay.\n\nStart your first SIP today.\n\nTeam PayWise", "labels": [], "clean": true}
